### 3. The Service Implementation

**File:** `com.tcs.fincore.CommonMasterService.service.CommonMasterServiceImpl.java`
I have modified `searchCommonRequests` to strictly filter for `LHO_TRANSFER`. It combines your `GenericSpecification` with a hardcoded `equal` check.

```java
@Override
public PaginatedResponseDto<CommonRequestDto> searchCommonRequests(SearchRequest request) {
    // 1. Setup Pagination & Sorting
    Sort.Direction direction = Sort.Direction.fromString(
            request.getSortOrder() != null ? request.getSortOrder() : "DESC");
    String sortField = request.getSortField() != null ? request.getSortField() : "requestDate";
    PageRequest pageRequest = PageRequest.of(request.getPage(), request.getSize(), Sort.by(direction, sortField));

    // 2. Create the "Strict" Specification for REQ_TYPE = LHO_TRANSFER
    Specification<CommonRequest> strictTypeSpec = (root, query, cb) -> 
            cb.equal(root.get("requestType"), "LHO_TRANSFER");

    // 3. Combine with the dynamic filters from the UI
    Specification<CommonRequest> combinedSpec = strictTypeSpec.and(GenericSpecification.build(request.getFilters()));

    // 4. Fetch from Repository
    Page<CommonRequest> page = commonRequestRepository.findAll(combinedSpec, pageRequest);

    if (page.isEmpty()) {
        throw new NoDataFoundException("No LHO Transfer requests found.");
    }

    List<CommonRequestDto> dtoList = page.getContent().stream()
            .map(this::mapToRequestDto)
            .toList();

    return new PaginatedResponseDto<>(
            page.getNumber(), 
            page.getTotalPages(), 
            page.getSize(), 
            page.getTotalElements(), 
            direction.name(), 
            dtoList
    );
}

@Override
public CommonRequestDto getRequestById(Long id) {
    CommonRequest req = commonRequestRepository.findById(id)
            .orElseThrow(() -> new NoDataFoundException("Request " + id + " not found."));
    
    // Security Check: Ensure the user isn't accessing a non-LHO_TRANSFER record via ID
    if (!"LHO_TRANSFER".equals(req.getRequestType())) {
        throw new IllegalArgumentException("Access Denied: Record is not an LHO Transfer.");
    }
    
    return mapToRequestDto(req);
}

private CommonRequestDto mapToRequestDto(CommonRequest entity) {
    return CommonRequestDto.builder()
            .id(entity.getId())
            .requestType(entity.getRequestType())
            .changeType(entity.getChangeType())
            .status(entity.getStatus())
            .requestDate(entity.getRequestDate())
            .creatorId(entity.getCreatorId())
            .creatorRemarks(entity.getCreatorRemarks())
            .executionDate(entity.getExecutionDate())
            .executionRemarks(entity.getExecutionRemarks())
            .executorId(entity.getExecutorId())
            .executorRemarks(entity.getExecutorRemarks())
            .payload(entity.getPayload())
            .targetId(entity.getTargetId())
            .build();
}

